{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id144352388"}, "name":{"label":"Blackbery-12"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-10-18T14:12:53-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.2026.279"}, "id":{"label":"14683119176"}, "title":{"label":"Incompetence"}, "content":{"label":"This is an actual conversation between ChatGPT and me:\n\nMe: Find me a local restaurant that serves Chinese crispy pork.\n\nChatGPT: I found a Chinese restaurant in California.\n\nMe: That’s not local. Why would you recommend a restaurant in California?\n\nChatGPT: Here’s a local Chinese restaurant that serves Cantonese food.\n\nMe: Why would a generic Chinese restaurant necessarily serve crispy pork? Can you check their menu?\n\nChatGPT: Oh, you’re right. They don’t serve it.\n\nThe most basic tasks and requests cannot be done without me having to do all the extra work myself.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=6448311069&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id1528942289"}, "name":{"label":"J M Suchy"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-10-18T14:00:40-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"2"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.2026.279"}, "id":{"label":"14683086349"}, "title":{"label":"Mistakes"}, "content":{"label":"It gets so much wrong. I use it a lot for big historical novels when I want to know more about the history of the era or how a character came into the story much earlier or the relationship of one to the other. etc. So many times with a followup question—incl when confronting it with their mistake—it apologizes for wrong or mistaken or mixed-up information. So now I will go to Gemini or Perplexity to check if Chat GPT is right.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=6448311069&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
