{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id198823825"}, "name":{"label":"All about free aps!"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-10-18T13:49:03-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"3"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.2026.279"}, "id":{"label":"14683055335"}, "title":{"label":"Why change face and body characteristics when told not to?"}, "content":{"label":"I have spent 3 hours trying to work with chatGPT on a 3 image combination built into a background graphic and each time there is a small edit, something else changes, even when told not to adjust anything.  I can’t count the number of times “we” have agreed and I have instructed and I have prompted to preserve ALL characteristics and even listed all of them for the face and the body, etc. and yet, ChatGPT continues to change the face to the point where it is not even similar to the original photo.  If I start over again, it can keep the fidelity of the original again, but with a couple of edits, we are back to an AI regenerated compilation that is not even close to the prompts and directions given.  I have even asked ChatGPT to help me prompt based on what we have learned and what has gone wrong and “we” STILL end up in the same place.  This is a fundamental flaw in the programming and machine learning.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=6448311069&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
